ttps://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/scaling_ecommerce_attribute_extraction/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/scaling_ecommerce_attribute_extraction/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Breaking the Autoregressive Chain: Hyper-Parallel Decoding for Efficient LLM-Based Attribute Value Extraction</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/hyper_parallel_decoding_attribute_extraction/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/hyper_parallel_decoding_attribute_extraction/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Text-to-Distribution Prediction with Quantile Tokens and Neighbor Context</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/text_to_distribution_quantile_tokens/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/text_to_distribution_quantile_tokens/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Quantile regression with large language models for price prediction</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/quantile_regression_llm_price_prediction/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/quantile_regression_llm_price_prediction/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Boosting Supervised Neural Relation Extraction with Distant Supervision</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/thesis/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 May 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/publication/thesis/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Deep-Learning</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/deep-learning/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/deep-learning/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Knowledge Distillation (using Tensorflow)</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/project/kd/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/project/kd/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is an implementation for the basic idea behind Hinton&amp;rsquo;s Knowledge Distillation Paper. We do not reproduce the exact results but rather show that the idea works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While a few other implementations are available, the code flow is not very intuitive. Here we generate the soft targets from the teacher in an on-line manner while training the student network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this may not (or may) be a good way to implement the distillation architecture, it leads to a good improvement in the (small) student model.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Machine-Learning</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/machine-learning/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/machine-learning/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Natural-Language-Processing</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/natural-language-processing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/natural-language-processing/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Projects</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/project/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/project/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tags</title><link>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/</link><pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2018 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>dush.dhyani@gmail.com (Dushyanta Dhyani)</author><guid>https://dushyantadhyani.github.io/tags/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>